  "name": "Validate All Domain Rules",
  "description": "Verify all 8 domain rules (DR-01 through DR-08) are enforced.\n\nDomain Rules to validate:\n- DR-01: Character has name, HP, attack_power, agility (all required)\n- DR-02: HP must be positive integer, attack_power and agility >= 1\n- DR-03: Damage equals attacker's attack_power\n- DR-04: Defender HP reduced by damage, floored at 0\n- DR-05: Combat ends when one character reaches 0 HP\n- DR-06: Attacker advantage - if attacker kills defender, no counter-attack\n- DR-07: Winner is survivor with HP > 0\n- DR-08: Initiative = agility + dice_roll, determines attack order",
  "motivation": "Domain rule validation ensures business logic is correctly implemented per requirements",
  "estimated_hours": 0.25,
  "execution_agent": "software-crafter",
  "dependencies": ["06-01"],
  "acceptance_criteria": [
    "DR-01 enforced: Character requires name, HP, attack_power, agility",
    "DR-02 enforced: HP positive, attack_power >= 1, agility >= 1",
    "DR-03 enforced: Damage = attack_power",
    "DR-04 enforced: HP reduction floors at 0",
    "DR-05 enforced: Combat ends at 0 HP",
    "DR-06 enforced: No counter-attack if defender dies",
    "DR-07 enforced: Winner has HP > 0",
    "DR-08 enforced: Initiative = agility + roll",
    "All E2E scenarios validate domain rules"
